From f4d539448a7bc0971912013d4cd12040b504cc89 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cizar-szymon <szymon@cs-lab.eu>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 13:10:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] 0.126: large games faster (searches only where an inventory
 can answer, road network parts, direction cycles without division, compact
 flags and map tiles, static tables, serfs read once), map preview progress
 and cache, the start takes the preview map, Large games option, profiling
 probes for simtest

